WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.400
Thanks to Babbel, a language learning&nbsp;
app, for sponsoring this episode.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.840
If you’re interested in growing your language&nbsp;
